<title>UK: BOE gives UK money market 90 mln stg late help.</title>
<headline>BOE gives UK money market 90 mln stg late help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said it provided the UK discount houses with 90 million stg of unspecified late assistance via repo.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7708</p>
